<title>CROATIA: Croatia April inflation 0.1 pct mo/mo, 4.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatia April inflation 0.1 pct mo/mo, 4.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES     APRIL  JAN-APRIL  MARCH   APRIL 96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	+0.1	--	+0.1	-0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year		  +4.4     4.1	+3.9	+2.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly inflation hit 38.7 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
